---
// Byte-by-byte comparison of struct field ordering on 64-bit Go:
// Unpadded {Active bool, ID int64, Flag uint8} = 24 bytes (14 bytes wasted padding)
// Padded   {ID int64, Active bool, Flag uint8} = 16 bytes (6 bytes trailing padding)
// Verified with unsafe.Sizeof and unsafe.Offsetof on Go 1.27.1.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;
const colW = 44; // 8 bytes * 44 = 352 px per 8-byte word
const lx = 70;
const rx = 510;
---
<figure class="gp16s">
  <div class="gp16s-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Memory layout of Unpadded struct taking 24 bytes with 14 bytes of padding versus Padded struct sorted largest to smallest taking 16 bytes with 6 bytes of trailing padding.">
    {/* Left: Unpadded 24 bytes */}
    <text x={lx} y="26" class="h">Unpadded</text>
    <text x={lx + 96} y="26" class="r num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>24 bytes (14 B padding)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>24 byte (14 B đệm)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Byte header 0..7 */}
    {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7].map((b) => (
      <text x={lx + b * colW + colW / 2} y="48" text-anchor="middle" class="m num">+{b}</text>
    ))}

    {/* Row 0x00: Active (1B) + 7B pad */}
    <text x="20" y="80" class="m num">0x00</text>
    <rect x={lx} y="56" width={colW} height="38" rx="4" class="data" />
    <text x={lx + colW / 2} y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Act</text>
    <rect x={lx + colW} y="56" width={7 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="pad" />
    <text x={lx + 4.5 * colW} y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>7 B compiler padding</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>7 B đệm căn lề</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Row 0x08: ID int64 (8B) */}
    <text x="20" y="130" class="m num">0x08</text>
    <rect x={lx} y="106" width={8 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="data" />
    <text x={lx + 4 * colW} y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="b">ID (int64 · 8 B)</text>

    {/* Row 0x10: Flag (1B) + 7B pad */}
    <text x="20" y="180" class="m num">0x10</text>
    <rect x={lx} y="156" width={colW} height="38" rx="4" class="data" />
    <text x={lx + colW / 2} y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Flg</text>
    <rect x={lx + colW} y="156" width={7 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="pad" />
    <text x={lx + 4.5 * colW} y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>7 B trailing padding</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>7 B đệm cuối struct</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right: Padded 16 bytes */}
    <text x={rx} y="26" class="h">Padded</text>
    <text x={rx + 78} y="26" class="goodtxt num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>16 bytes (6 B padding, −33%)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>16 byte (6 B đệm, giảm 33%)</tspan>
    </text>

    {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7].map((b) => (
      <text x={rx + b * colW + colW / 2} y="48" text-anchor="middle" class="m num">+{b}</text>
    ))}

    {/* Row 0x00: ID int64 (8B) */}
    <text x="460" y="80" class="m num">0x00</text>
    <rect x={rx} y="56" width={8 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="good" />
    <text x={rx + 4 * colW} y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="b">ID (int64 · 8 B)</text>

    {/* Row 0x08: Active (1B) + Flag (1B) + 6B pad */}
    <text x="460" y="130" class="m num">0x08</text>
    <rect x={rx} y="106" width={colW} height="38" rx="4" class="good" />
    <text x={rx + colW / 2} y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Act</text>
    <rect x={rx + colW} y="106" width={colW} height="38" rx="4" class="good" />
    <text x={rx + 1.5 * colW} y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="b">Flg</text>
    <rect x={rx + 2 * colW} y="106" width={6 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="mutedpad" />
    <text x={rx + 5 * colW} y="130" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>6 B trailing padding</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>6 B đệm cuối</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Row 0x10: saved! */}
    <text x="460" y="180" class="m num">0x10</text>
    <rect x={rx} y="156" width={8 * colW} height="38" rx="4" class="saved" />
    <text x={rx + 4 * colW} y="180" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>8 bytes freed for next item in slice</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tiết kiệm 8 byte cho phần tử kế tiếp</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Footer impact summary */}
    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="218" y2="218" class="rule" />
    <rect x="20" y="236" width="405" height="54" rx="8" class="pad" />
    <text x="36" y="260" class="b num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2M Unpadded structs: 48 MB RAM</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2 triệu Unpadded: 48 MB RAM</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="279" class="r num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Scan benchmark: ~2.8 ms/op (Apple M2)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đo duyệt slice: ~2,8 ms/op (Apple M2)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="460" y="236" width="420" height="54" rx="8" class="good" />
    <text x="476" y="260" class="b num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2M Padded structs: 32 MB RAM</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2 triệu Padded: 32 MB RAM</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="279" class="m num">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Scan benchmark: ~1.1 ms/op (fewer cache lines)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đo duyệt slice: ~1,1 ms/op (ít cache line hơn)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go never reorders struct fields for you, because alignment guarantees every <code>int64</code> starts on an 8-byte boundary. Moving <code>ID int64</code> ahead of two 1-byte flags shrinks the struct from 24 bytes to 16 bytes and cuts a 2-million-element scan from ~2.8 ms to ~1.1 ms on Apple M2.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Trình biên dịch Go không tự đổi thứ tự trường trong struct; để <code>int64</code> luôn nằm ở địa chỉ chia hết cho 8, Go chèn thêm byte đệm. Đưa <code>ID int64</code> lên trước hai biến 1 byte rút struct từ 24 byte còn 16 byte và giảm thời gian duyệt 2 triệu phần tử từ ~2,8 ms xuống ~1,1 ms trên Apple M2.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp16s { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp16s-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp16s svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp16s text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp16s .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16s .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp16s .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp16s .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp16s .goodtxt { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp16s .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp16s .data { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16s .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16s .pad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp16s .mutedpad { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp16s .saved { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp16s .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp16s figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
